{"02_After_10th_Polytechnic_Diploma/00_About_Polytechnic_Diploma":{"title":"Polytechnic Diploma after 10th – Telangana","sub":"Career Guidance – Telangana (India)","s":[{"h":"What is Polytechnic?","b":[{"t":"li","x":"3-year diploma in engineering/technology (some 3.5 yrs with 6 months industrial training)."},{"t":"li","x":"Board: TGSBTET – State Board of Technical Education & Training, Telangana."},{"t":"li","x":"Govt Polytechnics charge very low fees; fee reimbursement for eligible SC/ST/BC/EWS/minority students."},{"t":"li","x":"Diploma = equivalent to Intermediate for many purposes and allows lateral entry into 2nd year B.Tech."}]},{"h":"Admission – TG POLYCET","b":[{"t":"li","x":"Conducted by TGSBTET (usually April–May); eligibility 10th class (appearing students can also apply)."},{"t":"li","x":"Exam: 120 marks, 2 hours – Mathematics 60, Physics 30, Chemistry 30."},{"t":"li","x":"Agriculture/Veterinary diplomas: Maths/Biology option (PJTSAU, PVNRTVU, SKLTGHU use POLYCET ranks)."},{"t":"li","x":"Qualifying mark 30% (36/120); no minimum for SC/ST."},{"t":"li","x":"Counselling online: tgpolycet.nic.in – choose branch & college."}]},{"h":"All branches (see each folder)","b":[{"t":"table","h":["#","Branch"],"r":[["1","Diploma in Civil Engineering (DCE)"],["2","Diploma in Mechanical Engineering (DME)"],["3","Diploma in Electrical & Electronics Engineering (EEE)"],["4","Diploma in Electronics & Communication Engineering (ECE)"],["5","Diploma in Computer Engineering (CME)"],["6","Diploma in Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning"],["7","Diploma in Automobile Engineering (DAE)"],["8","Diploma in Chemical Engineering (DCH)"],["9","Diploma in Mining Engineering"],["10","Diploma in Metallurgical Engineering"],["11","Diploma in Textile Technology"],["12","Diploma in Architectural Assistantship"],["13","Diploma in Electronics & Instrumentation"],["14","Diploma in Commercial & Computer Practice (DCCP)"]]}]},{"h":"Pass Percentage Rules","b":[{"t":"table","h":["Item","Minim